        "src": "media\\B06.mp4",
        "filled_by": "remotion:FormACard916",
        "at": "2026-10-23T15:08:21"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "THE RESULT",
      "narration_text": "The result, from three seeds each. The plain CNN reaches eighty three point nine. The ResNet reaches seventy nine point six, about four points lower with six and a half times the parameters, and far less stable from seed to seed. The published result of eighty two point two is not on this chart, because its network and training differ from ours.",
